-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EVE Online Static Data Export (SDE)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The base entry (`eve-fit-engine`) contains NO EVE Online game data: it operates
on a `FittingDataset` that the consumer supplies at runtime.

The Node entry (`eve-fit-engine/node`) is batteries-included, and the published
package therefore DOES ship a snapshot of the EVE Online Static Data Export
under `data/` (~8 MB). That snapshot is included purely by MERE AGGREGATION
with the GPL-covered program: it is not part of the program, it is not
relicensed by the GPL, and it remains governed by its own terms. See
`data/SDE-LICENSE.md`.

